WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.131
When you train your own model, you write the model card. Training data, hyperparameters, validation methodology — all yours.

2
00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:14.504
When you use a foundation model behind an A P I, your view ends at the A P I boundary.

3
00:00:14.533 --> 00:00:17.264
Documentation completeness breaks.

4
00:00:17.267 --> 00:00:25.118
The fix is to document your layer and the vendor layer separately, and to treat a vendor model version change as a model change.
